#
# This file is used to as input to the simulator for testing the dataServer.
#
# File format is as follows. 
#
#   file name		: (string)	pathname to file.
#   dataset name	: (string)	dataset name the file belongs to.
#   IMP idenity		: (string)	Identity to send the file as. 
#   Relative time	: (int)		Number of milliseconds after the 
#					    synch time to send the commands 
#					    and file. 
#   File type		: (char) 	One of 'F', R', 'D' or 'Q' 
#					    ( FITS, RAW, DATASET, i
#					      DATASET for QUICKLOOK ONLY ).
#   Last flag		: (char)	One of 'T' or 'F' ( TRUE or FALSE ).
#   Are we Master?	: (char)	One of 'T' or 'F' ( TRUE or FALSE ).
#   Life time		: (char)	One of 'T', 'P', or 'Q' 
#					    ( TEMPORARY, PERMANENT, or 
#					      QUICKLOOK-TRANSIENT ).
#   List of Contribs	: (string)	Must be a quoted, space-delimited 
#					    list of the contributors
#   Quicklook Streams	: (string)	Must be a quoted, space-delimited 
#					    list of the quicklook streams
#
#
# File					Dataset		IMP		Relative	File	Last	Are we 	Life	List of 	QuickLook
# Name					Name   		identity 	Time    	Type	Flag	Master?	Time	Contribs	Streams
# ---- 				 	-------		--------	--------	----	----	-------	----	--------	---------
#

